<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">Zuda Châ Paphaopa</book>
  <para style="h">Zuda Châ Paphaopa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zuda Châ Paphaopa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zuda Châ Paphaopa</para>
  <para style="mt">Zuda Châ Paphaopa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zisu Krista chakaotuhpa nata Zâmie unawhpa Zudâh ta Paw Khazohpa liata kyhpachâpa nata Zisu Krista châta awpa nata vaipa sahlaozy ei châ naoh ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zawngiahna zy, thlalôhna zy, kyhpachâna zy nama chô liata pôh rili mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kho ngaitapa saih u, mo to ta pachhana eima topa thâtih nama hnohta ro awpa ei kho kaw nota, mopathaihpazy hnohta chhâzaw châta ei kha piepa ngiapâna a duakhei lymâ awpa ta, nâmo lâ ahawna tao awpa â ngiahpa ta ei pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chyhsa thokha, kha hlâ tawhta thaileichâ awpa ta rao chiehpazy arulâta amâ vaw ngia. Cha chyhsazy cha Khazohpa a uasa leipazy châ ei ta, eima Khazohpa ngiachhiena cha parâna châta hmâh ei ta, eima Hyutuhpa nata eima Beipa hnei chhôhpa Zisu Krista a paphasaipazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nama pahno chiehpa a châ tarawpa ta, he bie he ei cha chho chanei khoh heih ei. Phopi miakha cha Zisu ta Izi râh tawhta pachha papua ta, a hnôhlâ ta a ngiapâleipazy a pahleipadia lilaw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpazy chhao ama biehneina nata ama pahrâna su a siesaipazy cha, noh rônahpa pachiana noh tlôna taihta zohna hnabeidyna ry liata chhâzaw bâlia ta chahrypa ta y awpa ta Abeipa ta a soh chy ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sawdawmâ nata Kawmawrâ nata ama chheipâh khihpizy chhao kha, apatlana moleinazy thata tao ei ta, chanô chapaw châna hmâzie tyhpa a châ leipa, chapaw nata chapaw apatlanazy taihta ama taopa vâta, chhâzaw mei ta hriepa châ ei ta, pakhona châta hmâpa ama vaw châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cha chyhsazy chhao, cha hawhta y ei ta, ama mâzy liata a pahnieh ei ta, ama pôhpa papuapalei ei ta, biehneina mopakhô ei ta, chyhsa rônahpazy ama reipachhie tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa chônôchaipa Mikaila tlai chhao khata, Mawsi ri kyh liata ahripa nata a chhu ei ta, ahripa â dyuh nona kha, reipachhiena pachiana bie phuah leipa ta, “Abeipa ta cha ra mawh sy,” tlao a tah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cha chyhsazy deikua chata ama pahno leipa maih reipachhie ei ta, pachâna a hnei leipa sazy ta ama pikheipa pahnona ama zi thlâhpa hawhta, âmo chhao ama pikheipa pahnona zi hra ei ta, cha chata a pahleipadia ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama hu a po na! Kaina lâpi a chhih ei ta, athôhna hmô awpa ta Bâlâma moleina lâpi liata a râ ei ta, Kôrâ adyuhna liata ama leidia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chazy chata china châh rai pahno leipa ta, nama kyhpachâna kyhchhi patizy niepa ta papuapalei ei ta, ti hnei leipa meihdo, thlih ta a phao pahaipa, châhvâ tho a pathei leipa, ei no a thi hapa nata a thari phia hapazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tilaipi chatlaopa a pathluahpa, âmo maophyuhna buchaphy a papuapazy châ ei ta, awhsi viavipa, zoh kaluhpa liata chhâzaw ta a y awpazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cha hawhpa chyhsazy thâtih cha, Âdâh tawhta chhâ sarina Enawka chhao ta, “Moh teh u, Abeipa cha a vâlyuhchâpa pathaihpa thy kha chhaota â vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chyhsa zydua pachia aw ta, Khazohpa a uasa leipazy cha, Khazohpa kho leipa hmo ama taopa zydua vâta thailei a pachâsa aw ei. Khazohpa uasa leipa ta, Khazohpa chô liata bie pachyupa a reihpazy chhao thailei a pachâsa aw ei,” tahpa ta a vaw chhochhielie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cha hawhpa chyhsazy cha, ama moleina hmo khopazy chadaipa ta, paphôhpalyuh thaipa nata reipasipasua a hmâhpazy châ ei ta, athôhna hmô khoh vâta khokhei viapa hneipa ta, pakah kawhpa ta a palaipazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kho ngaitapa saih u, nâmo deikua la, eima Beipa Zisu Krista lyuhchâpazy bie chhochhieliepa kha a thei thlâh ha muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lyuhchâpazy ta, “Daihti hnôhchaipa liata cha, pasipasawh a hmâhpa, Khazohpa uasa leipa ta ama aohraohnazy a chadaipa ama y aw,” tahpa ta ama cha vaw chho haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cha chyhsazy cha achhaihna a patlôsatuhpa, khizawpa chyhsa, Thlahpa a hnei leipazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kho ngaitapa saih u, nâmo deikua la, namâ ngiapâna pathaih ngaitapa liata nâmosasyh tha a patlô u la, Thlahpa Pathaihpa ta thlahchhâ muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khazohpa kyhpachâna liata a pabohsa u la, eima Beipa Zisu Krista ngiachhiena, chhâzaw hrona lâ a chhi theipa cha hâ muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Alôhleipazy thapasa u la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />mohropazy mei tawhta chhu u la, pachha teh u. Ahropazy chhao china chôta thapasa u la, sapa moleina a baipa chyhsiazy taih a hao teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tahmâ he nama pao lei nawpa ta châ hrôbieh theipa ei nata a rônahna hmiakô liata seina hnei leipa ta, a ly ngaitapa ta châ soh theipa ei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />eima Beipa Zisu Krista zawhzi ta miah Pachhatuhpa Khazohpa a y chhôhpa hnohna chata rônahna zy, abeina zy, ryureina zy, biehneina zy cha, daihti khô chiehpa zydua nata tahmâ nata tlyzaw ta y thlâh ha mawh sy. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
